---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getRolls } from '../lib/rolls';
import portrait from '../assets/photos/roll-005/10.jpg';

const rolls = await getRolls();
const frames = rolls.reduce((n, r) => n + r.data.exposures.length, 0);

const coffeeUrl = 'https://buymeacoffee.com/jesmith4evb';
---

<Base title="About" compact>
  <section class="about">
    <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>

    <div class="about__intro">
      <div class="about__body">
        <p>
          Jamm is Jeremy, Samm, and a refurbished Minolta X-700 that we picked up
          before we left Atlanta to travel around Europe for the summer.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't know what we're doing and that's the most fun part. Exposures come back
          too dark, too bright, mostly out of focus. Jeremy thinks the "focusing plate" is out of wack
          but we don't have an easy way to fix it on the move. We're uploading each roll whole, in the
          order it was shot with the misses left in next to the few that hit. Hopefully,
          we get better as the weeks roll on.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you want to take part, we set up a "Buy Me a Coffee" account. You 
          can send some money and a note with what we should spend it on and we'll
          photograph it and post it with the next roll.
        </p>
        <a class="about__coffee" href={coffeeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Buy Me a Coffee →
        </a>
      </div>

      <figure class="about__figure">
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="A hand holding a small glass jar of coffee up behind the leaves of a plant in a café window."
          widths={[480, 720, 1080]}
          sizes="(max-width: 60rem) 100vw, 22rem"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <dl class="colophon">
      <div>
        <dt>Rolls</dt>
        <dd>{rolls.length} archived</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Exposures</dt>
        <dd>{frames} frames</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Contact</dt>
        <dd><a href="mailto:jesmith4ever@gmail.com">jesmith4ever@gmail.com</a></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>
</Base>
